    ("MITTS_NO_SOURCE_FALLBACK", "1", "<b>Installer.</b> Without it, when GitHub is unreachable or the platform has no prebuilt binary, the installer builds from crates.io with Cargo if Cargo is installed. Set it to fail instead (for CI).", "MITTS_NO_SOURCE_FALLBACK=1 sh install.sh"),
